Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.12,0:00:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.84,0:01:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they were no match.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.22,0:02:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using the power of the light, War\NGreymon was finally able to destroy Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.44,0:02:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,MetalGreymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.86,0:02:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sure glad Kari's okay now.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.52,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,330,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}A Woman's Fight! LadyDevimon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.92,0:02:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, just when you think\Nit can't get any weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.74,0:02:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like the whole city\Nis moving out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.54,0:02:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I thought it was\Ntough packing for camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.66,0:02:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time must have defeated\Nanother Dark Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.26,0:02:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There can't be too many of them left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost home free.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.92,0:02:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think so, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.04,0:02:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the toughest one's still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.32,0:02:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the worst of the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.88,0:02:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the darkest of the Dark Masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.74,0:02:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, like rain on our\Nparade, why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.70,0:02:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.61,0:02:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll need all the help we can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.26,0:02:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if superheroes are\Nlisted in the phone book.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.60,0:02:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's find some friends, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.94,0:03:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Round up as many as you\Nwant, the more the merrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.70,0:03:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice having friends around\Nto share your last moments with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.84,0:03:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, why is it we're\Nalways walking uphill?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.34,0:03:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.38,0:03:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get numb back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.32,0:03:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a little room, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.36,0:03:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You too, you walking barbecue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.46,0:03:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be walking uphill I can deal with, but\NI sure could use a pair of earplugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.62,0:03:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry. I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.70,0:03:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My feet hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.78,0:03:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, I don't know what to\Ndo when you're like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.74,0:03:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.65,0:03:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Mimi just said\Nthat she was hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.74,0:03:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.02,0:03:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be back with food\Nbefore you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't put yourself out, but if you're going,\Na chili dog with fries would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.26,0:03:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And of course the princess will\Nbe wanting something to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.01,0:03:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry about\Na thing, princess Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.98,0:03:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait. Come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.76,0:03:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.06,0:03:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll tag along.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:03:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, everybody's being so nice. So sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be because of\Nyour charming personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something tells me we should\Njust nod our heads and go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.48,0:04:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right. Come on. Admit it, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.46,0:04:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say it. She's charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.12,0:04:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.34,0:04:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.36,0:04:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna have this conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.30,0:04:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.80,0:04:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.26,0:04:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, my favorite!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.52,0:04:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this room there's warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.84,0:04:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.44,0:04:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.86,0:04:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, get it while it's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.08,0:04:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, I'll admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.08,0:04:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess you guys are kind of handy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.32,0:04:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, Joe, let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.62,0:04:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be a doctor\Nif you don't want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.04,0:04:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy for you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:04:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try telling that to Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.28,0:05:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your life, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.58,0:05:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to live it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.84,0:05:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to follow your own path.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.30,0:05:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Obramod.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.30,0:05:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.60,0:05:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stand guard for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.94,0:05:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.85,0:05:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are sure you can handle it,\Nlittle guy? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.34,0:05:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can handle it fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't even handle combing your\Nhair, but I could use a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.88,0:05:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jim's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.79,0:05:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a doormat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.10,0:05:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good for a laugh. A joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.82,0:05:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good old Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can always rely on him to\Nfall into the mud or off a cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.68,0:05:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for a brand new Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How delightfully entertaining\Nthis is. I always get so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before tragedy strikes thank you\Nnew Mammon we'll never forget
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.14,0:05:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you you'll always be in our\Nhearts and our memories and don't
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.38,0:05:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,worry we'll make sure that you\Nget reborn in primary village
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ever notice how we're\Nalways walking uphill
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.10,0:06:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay nice view but what are we\Nlooking for that over there if
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.38,0:06:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that doesn't look like a bad guys\Nhang out i don't know what does
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.10,0:06:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remarkable little specimens i'm really\Nrather embarrassed that they made it this far
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.34,0:06:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh please please lord\Npython let me punish them
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.04,0:06:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,very well but try to make\Nit quick and relatively
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.28,0:06:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm rested and ready to work\Noff that snack, so let's go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.84,0:06:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, when Mimi's in a good mood,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's hard to be around\Nher and not be happy, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:06:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just my little gift to the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:07:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're awfully quiet, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.34,0:07:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.25,0:07:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.17,0:07:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe you. Oh, no! Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.62,0:07:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.46,0:07:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like an old\NTwilight Zone episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.16,0:07:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you not to expect too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.06,0:07:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The powder is all missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.32,0:07:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty depressing, unless\Nyou're a big fan of charcoal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.66,0:07:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe anybody would\Ndo such a terrible thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smashing all those poor defenseless\NDigi-Eggs, it's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.14,0:07:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.44,0:07:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.56,0:07:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.12,0:07:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that a harmonica?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.12,0:07:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think it's... Max!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.94,0:07:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are they headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.76,0:07:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.67,0:07:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.04,0:07:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it. We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.64,0:08:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great, Izzy, but ready for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on a second and you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.94,0:08:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Andromon, show us your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.02,0:08:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Engage heat conduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.32,0:08:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get what's\Nhappening. It's really rather
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.52,0:08:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,simple andromon acquires geothermal energy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.20,0:08:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,directly from the ground\Nwait cool hey that's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.62,0:08:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spiral mountain isn't\Nit this is like having
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our own portable microwave\Nthere look that's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where we are right now\Nright on top that doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,make sense how do we get up there i'm sure
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.44,0:08:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,glad i can't see down i\Ndon't like high places
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's like Shellmon said\Nthe most powerful dark
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.74,0:08:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,masters live way on top\Nof spiral mountain see
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.50,0:08:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i told you we were close\Nwe'll give you a medal
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.02,0:08:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,later intruder warning\Ninterloper detected huh
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.08,0:09:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pile of recycled scrap\Nmetal, you spoiled my entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.32,0:09:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should have known there'd\Nbe a welcoming committee.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.12,0:09:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She looks like a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.76,0:09:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's one of the Nightmare\NSoldiers. LadyDevimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.72,0:09:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure you're\Ntired, you poor things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.82,0:09:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A nice long rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.52,0:09:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.34,0:09:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.22,0:09:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poromon, Digivolve, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.64,0:09:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.24,0:09:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Puzzleprap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.54,0:09:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.20,0:09:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.14,0:09:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon, Digivolve, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.50,0:09:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Digivolve to Piyomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.64,0:09:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fun Rumble!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.20,0:10:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then come on, Digivolve to Tentomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.98,0:10:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.60,0:10:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then come on, Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.82,0:10:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just made my job a lot easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darkness wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, are we just pretending?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me know when you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.46,0:11:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hands of faith!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.66,0:11:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy Arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.66,0:11:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.62,0:11:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.84,0:11:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.96,0:11:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll keep you in reserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.52,0:11:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me warp Digivolve, and I can take\Ncare of this black-and-white nightmare?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.92,0:11:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, what's your Digimon\Nanalyzer say about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.60,0:11:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.34,0:11:48.35,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}LadyDevimon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.34,0:11:48.35,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.34,0:11:48.35,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.34,0:11:48.35,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Fallen Angel Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.34,0:11:48.35,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.34,0:11:48.35,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,340,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Darkness Wave\NPoison
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.51,0:11:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Devimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Programmed to be the ultimate\Nfully digivolved fighting soldier,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.88,0:11:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she serves as gatekeeper and\Nbodyguard for the last Dark Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.96,0:11:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.32,0:11:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to do this right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, you and T.K. take\NAngemon and Birdramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.18,0:11:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find Matt and bring him back. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.62,0:12:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want us to leave right\Nin the middle of a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.71,0:12:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll manage from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.76,0:12:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.90,0:12:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if worse comes to worse,\Nwe always have our trump card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,WarGreymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm a trump card, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.48,0:12:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time's come to stop acting\Nlike a bunch of children.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.44,0:12:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're facing the last of the Dark Masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.64,0:12:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hydemon. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.34,0:12:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know where he'll strike or\Nwhen, but it'll be somewhere close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.00,0:12:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.42,0:12:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.02,0:12:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.42,0:12:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.78,0:12:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't be just another fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's for kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.88,0:12:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to be ready for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.94,0:12:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's why you want us to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to find my brother and bring him\Nback before Piedmon shows up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.18,0:12:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Ty's looking at the big picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.46,0:12:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not about this fight,\Nbut the next one, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.84,0:12:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.82,0:12:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Faces loaded, two out, and\Nwe need a slam dunk. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.20,0:12:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we've been doing is meeting each\Nthreat as it comes, barely holding on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.20,0:13:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we've got to put it\Nall together, as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.84,0:13:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means Matt, Mimi, and Joe, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.98,0:13:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've let enough Digimon\Nsacrifice themselves for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.20,0:13:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.62,0:13:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.90,0:13:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Celestial!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, Jamon! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.34,0:13:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Bergamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.92,0:13:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, Blondie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.98,0:13:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, Jamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.16,0:13:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you soon, Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.32,0:13:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't worry we'll find matt and\Nmimi and joe and be back before you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.08,0:13:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know it try and hurry this is kind\Nof important i'll do the best i can
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.22,0:13:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well well let's just see how\Nour little drama is unraveling
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.42,0:14:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh so it was you we thought it was someone\Nelse yeah i'm sure you did it's always
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.54,0:14:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same thing. I'm just a constant source
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of disappointment to everybody hey how's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.46,0:14:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Betamon and dk they all right yeah and i\Nknow that both of them will be really happy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to see you alecmon yeah not that we're not\Nof course you're right i'm sure nice try
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.24,0:14:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey i know why don't you come\Nalong with us huh yeah we're
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.74,0:14:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gonna defeat those creepy\Ndark masters once and for all,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.48,0:14:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and fix up Primary Village, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.66,0:14:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need all the friends we can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.10,0:14:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know we don't look like much now,\Nbut maybe with your help, we can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take on the Dark Masters?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.20,0:14:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.76,0:14:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may be down, but I don't want to be out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.64,0:14:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your information, we've taken them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.04,0:14:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, we've already\Ndefeated most of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK and Patamon have\Nreally been incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.82,0:14:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK and Patamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.94,0:14:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.66,0:14:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those sweet kids are mixing\Nit up with the Dark Masters?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.38,0:15:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, if they're crazy enough\Nto fight him, then I am, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.84,0:15:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You twisted my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.12,0:15:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frankly, you guys are lucky to\Nhave gotten this far without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.46,0:15:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.86,0:15:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, Elecmon, where'd\Nyou get that harmonica?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.82,0:15:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.76,0:15:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found it on the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.36,0:15:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody must have dropped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.90,0:15:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I take a look at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.74,0:15:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.98,0:15:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's definitely Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means he must be\Naround here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.50,0:15:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, do you think he might have gone across?\NThat's a long way to swim. Now that you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.50,0:15:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mention it i saw somebody\Ncross the water last
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.42,0:15:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,night i thought it was\None of those nightmare
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.14,0:15:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soldiers fooling around\Nbut come to think of
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.40,0:15:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it they probably wouldn't\Nbe using a boat shaped
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.50,0:15:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like a swan it was a\Nswan that settles it it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had to have been mad i\Ncan just picture it now
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.82,0:15:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Mimi
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:15:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got a lot of\Nfriends now Will you be
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay if Gomamon and I go off for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.17,0:16:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.09,0:16:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go off for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go where?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.91,0:16:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, I guess\Nwherever Matt's gone to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.52,0:16:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.43,0:16:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well I'll come with you\Nand help you find him
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.18,0:16:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not this time Just Gomamon can go Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.98,0:16:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.96,0:16:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We each have our own path to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.42,0:16:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.26,0:16:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai knows what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.88,0:16:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knows where he fits in, and so do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.42,0:16:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So do the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.52,0:16:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.08,0:16:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I know that we're in\Nfor the fight of our lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.38,0:16:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and part of me knows that\NI should stay and help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.42,0:16:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.33,0:16:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to count on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.30,0:16:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm unreliable, then\NGomamon can't fully digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.10,0:16:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're like circus clowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.54,0:16:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.54,0:16:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.64,0:16:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.98,0:16:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't call me old reliable for\Nnothing, but they don't I'll ignore that I
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.68,0:16:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think Matt was searching for\Nthe same thing when he left
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.14,0:16:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I want to know if he\Nfound it somewhere out there
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then again, it might be\Na total waste of time
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just an idea, if you\Nfeel that strongly about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.50,0:17:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be the right thing.\NYou sure about this, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.76,0:17:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let the kid go his own way
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.84,0:17:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm with you buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.54,0:17:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's stronger than he looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.40,0:17:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darkness Wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.98,0:17:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.62,0:17:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.10,0:17:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.16,0:17:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon evolved to...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.48,0:17:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mega Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.62,0:18:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never did like that bleached look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.60,0:18:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go, let me add her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.66,0:18:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, look at him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.54,0:18:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I shouldn't watch this,\Nbut I can't take my eyes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.04,0:18:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get her on to a mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.22,0:18:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.13,0:18:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock that witch's rock off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.34,0:18:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.38,0:18:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.62,0:18:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This game is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.56,0:18:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your ground's in Goldilocks Black Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.50,0:18:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You broke it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.08,0:18:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Send me the bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.50,0:18:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, Lady Devimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This game is over. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.14,0:18:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snus-yut! Darkness! Heaven! Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:18:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Milton!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.92,0:19:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.14,0:19:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's my back?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.50,0:19:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.60,0:19:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope it didn't leave a scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.28,0:19:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, you see what I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.44,0:19:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.38,0:19:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look good, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.88,0:19:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Piemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.24,0:19:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy's not exactly in a hurry, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.46,0:19:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suit up, Agumon. You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.60,0:19:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, warp Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.60,0:19:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.52,0:20:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon, and the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.76,0:20:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.60,0:20:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.26,0:20:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, he's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.84,0:20:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't even know how strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.48,0:20:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.78,0:20:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, I'm only worried\Nabout dying of old age.
